- Lab assay → Oil Manager: completeness, TBP/ASTM, density, light ends, hypo generation, cuts, blends, feed attach
- States **O0–O4 / OX** (`assay_engine.py`); inventory gate: `docs/INTELLIGENCE_INVENTORY.md`
- Never auto-save `.hsc`; no silent Oil Manager / property-package rewrite

